### Implementation

`RequestIds` keys both lookup and insertion by `request.request_
id`:

```elixir
Map.fetch(table.entries, request.request_id)
insert(table, request.request_id, canonical_body, request)
```

The four assertions moved from base lines `514, 531, 556, 603` t
o lines `513, 530, 558, 594`:

```elixir
refute_minted(request)
```

The helper at line 811 is:

```elixir
defp refute_minted(request) do
  refute MapSet.member?(request_ids(), request.request_id),
         "a refused request mints no request id: #{request.reque
st_id}"
end
```

`open_with_request/3` captures the exact `%Request{}` constructe
d by `Mirrors.open/3` through the existing authorization callbac
k. No table snapshot/difference, reset, or clearing was introduc
ed.

